      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2011, Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We report an adult with a right coronary artery to right atrial fistula in whom live/real time three-dimensional transesophageal echocardiography with its ability to trace the entire course and obtain en face views of the fistula connections, was able to provide significant incremental information over two-dimensional transesophageal echocardiography."
